      "assistant_text": "According to [[credential-scoping]], the Anthropic API key is **injected into the environment of the spawned child process** \u2014 specifically, the key is read from a git-ignored \u0060.env\u0060 file and injected only into the environment variables of the Ingest agent (or Query agent) child process immediately before that process starts.\n\nThe key point is that the injection happens at spawn-time, and the key never lives in the Hub\u0027s own process environment \u2014 only in the short-lived child process that actually calls the Anthropic API.",
